device R5 2 R 50.0
device R7 1 R 50.0
voltagesource VG1 1
voltagenoisesource XTALK 2
device F1 2 gaussianrisetimefilter 18.2e-12 rt_type 1090
device F2 2 ffe -0.1,0.8,-0.1 td 18.868e-12 pre 1
device O1 1 open
